SUMMARY:The Moon occults Venus
DESCRIPTION:Venus disappears at 17:19:30 and reappears at 18:31:33 IST\, se
 en from Hubli.\nThe Moon is 41° up in the SW · daylight\, Sun +17°.\nTi
 mes against the real lunar limb.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moon's
  edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Hubli
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Hubli
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
